sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor user as User
  participant inst as install.sh / setup.sh
  participant cat as Catalog
  participant net as GitHub + Hugging Face
  participant ag as Hermes + OMP installers
  participant mv as meshvault CLI
  user->>inst: curl ... install.sh | bash
  inst->>net: clone repo at newest v* tag
  inst->>cat: choose largest model that fits RAM
  inst->>net: download llama.cpp and GGUF
  Note over inst,cat: sha256 verified against catalog
  inst->>ag: run official Hermes and OMP installers
  inst->>mv: write config.env, optional autostart on
  inst->>mv: end-to-end check: model answers
  inst-->>user: meshvault doctor, then hermes
